## HEAVY
The lane runs dotnet build and test (about 10 s build and 2 s test on a warm cache; 6 builds in all with the mutants). The project's rule: take a slot by atomic `mkdir '<project>/.tools/.heavy-lock-1'` (else `-2`; neither free: poll every 60 s), write `holder.txt` (pane name, label, `date`), run the jobs of steps 3, 4 and 5, release by MOVING the holder file to `.tools/b1706/logs/` and `rmdir` your own dir. **Load gate: `LC_ALL=C uptime` load1 under 24 on TWO reads 120 s apart (not independent: say so)**. A holder older than 30 minutes with no live pane is REPORTED, never removed. A wait is not a finding; waited 30 minutes: say so; at the hard stop `BLOCKED: heavy lock waiting at load <n>`.

